{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beat-\u2018em-up action on the high seas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a swashbuckling pirate on a mission to reclaim your stolen ship and treasure map! Fight your way through waves of rival marauders, steal from uppity civilians, and unleash fierce companion parrots in this fast-paced, belt-scrolling brawler packed with humor and mayhem. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/trailer_4_players.gif?t=1743103993\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore stages filled with unique hazards and dynamic environments \u2014such as slippery rooftops, deep underwater, and horse-pulled carriage rides! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/paddle_boarding_01_-_800px.gif?t=1743103993\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from 4 unique pirate heroes, each with distinct speeds, attacks, and special moves, including Simon, Coralie, Portia, and the hook-handed Aldemar. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/trailer_1_player.gif?t=1743103993\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 9 stages with varied environments, enemies, and gameplay mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 playable heroes with unique stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Treasure chests with power-ups and weapons, including pistols and whips</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast-paced gameplay - enemies quickly recover from knockdown attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Companion assists and special moves with short cooldown times, allowing for frequent use</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Swift, satisfying boss battles that don\u2019t overstay their welcome \u2014no damage sponges here!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Up to 4-player local co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Classic Game Mode: This campaign recreates the original 1989 arcade game and retains its single-player, single-plane gameplay, as well as its graphics and music.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ORIGIN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buccaneers: Shipshape is an official remake of the 1989 Buccaneers arcade game, created with full support from the original developer, Duintronic S.A. This revamped version introduces exciting new features, including Z-axis movement, additional heroes and villains, brand-new stages, revamped soundtrack and much more!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1962760?t=1743103993","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/adb9bd2d895eb4952380bd052ce544d2689d4198/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743103993","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/6c905e0271a4ce8b80cfb6dd9c84f23c2f860243/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743103993","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/6c905e0271a4ce8b80cfb6dd9c84f23c2f860243/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743103993","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2020600,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beat-\u2018em-up action on the high seas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a swashbuckling pirate on a mission to reclaim your stolen ship and treasure map! Fight your way through waves of rival marauders, steal from uppity civilians, and unleash fierce companion parrots in this fast-paced, belt-scrolling brawler packed with humor and mayhem. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/trailer_4_players.gif?t=1743103993\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore stages filled with unique hazards and dynamic environments \u2014such as slippery rooftops, deep underwater, and horse-pulled carriage rides! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/paddle_boarding_01_-_800px.gif?t=1743103993\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from 4 unique pirate heroes, each with distinct speeds, attacks, and special moves, including Simon, Coralie, Portia, and the hook-handed Aldemar. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/trailer_1_player.gif?t=1743103993\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 9 stages with varied environments, enemies, and gameplay mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 playable heroes with unique stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Treasure chests with power-ups and weapons, including pistols and whips</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast-paced gameplay - enemies quickly recover from knockdown attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Companion assists and special moves with short cooldown times, allowing for frequent use</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Swift, satisfying boss battles that don\u2019t overstay their welcome \u2014no damage sponges here!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Up to 4-player local co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Classic Game Mode: This campaign recreates the original 1989 arcade game and retains its single-player, single-plane gameplay, as well as its graphics and music.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ORIGIN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buccaneers: Shipshape is an official remake of the 1989 Buccaneers arcade game, created with full support from the original developer, Duintronic S.A. This revamped version introduces exciting new features, including Z-axis movement, additional heroes and villains, brand-new stages, revamped soundtrack and much more!</p>","developers":["Merso Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/cb8b623cff974ef22f7c0a3b02fffb8895a729c1/header.jpg?t=1743103993","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Merso Entertainment - 2022, all rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257095752,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257095752/movie480.mp4?t=1739239531","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257095752/movie_max.mp4?t=1739239531"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257095752/9dec885801dc23ad6b3f7d983cb1befb36f6ed72/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1739239531","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257095752/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1739239531","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257095752/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1739239531"}}],"name":"Buccaneers: Shipshape","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 32-bit</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Merso Entertainment"],"ratings":{